# Confirms the pre-existing READ_RESTART+FUNCTIONAL path (skips the DHF SCF entirely, loads
# orbitals from RESTART.4C, goes straight into functional evaluation) is unaffected by the
# SCF_DIRECT_4C changes -- this code path is untouched (SCF_DIRECT_4C TRUE + READ_RESTART TRUE is
# explicitly rejected by Input.cpp's validation; this input intentionally omits SCF_DIRECT_4C).
# Reads the RESTART.4C written by examples/h2_sto3g_c4_scf_direct_muller.inp (or the dense
# reference) -- same geometry/basis/functional, result should match both of those runs' energies.
NELEC 2
BASIS water-sto-3g.gbs
C4_SPINOR TRUE
FUNCTIONAL MULLER
READ_RESTART TRUE

GEOMETRY
H   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   0.741400
END
